===Summary===
In the 69th minute, Corinthians took the lead when a shot from [[Danilo (footballer, born 1979)|Danilo]] was blocked by Chelsea defender [[Gary Cahill]] before looping up in the air where [[Paolo Guerrero]] headed into the net from close range past three Chelsea defenders on the line.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/20746503#:~:text=The%20Blues%20ended%20the%20game,to%20win%20the%20competition%20twice.|title=Chelsea 0-1 Corinthians|date=16 December 2012|work=BBC Sport|accessdate=25 June 2026}}</ref>

